@startuml COM3_Enterprise_UseCases

title COM3 — Enterprise Viewpoint — Assured Operation Interaction

left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle

actor "Service Consumer" as Consumer
actor "Service Provider" as Provider

rectangle "Assured Operation Interaction Engineering Service" {

  usecase "ENT-OBL-COM3-01\nConduct interaction for one\nDeclared Operation" as ENT01

  usecase "ENT-OBL-COM3-02\nPreserve Operation form" as ENT02

  usecase "ENT-OBL-COM3-03\nPreserve Invocation\nconformance" as ENT03

  usecase "ENT-OBL-COM3-04\nPreserve Announcement\ntermination independence" as ENT04

  usecase "ENT-OBL-COM3-05\nEstablish declared termination\nfor completed Interrogation" as ENT05

  usecase "ENT-OBL-COM3-06\nPreserve Invocation–Termination\nassociation" as ENT06
}

Consumer --> ENT01
Provider --> ENT01

ENT01 ..> ENT02 : <<requires>>
ENT01 ..> ENT03 : <<requires>>

ENT02 ..> ENT04 : Announcement
ENT02 ..> ENT05 : Interrogation

ENT05 ..> ENT06 : <<requires>>

note bottom of ENT04
G-COM3-04
Announcement does not require
a contractual Operation Termination.
end note

note bottom of ENT05
G-COM3-05
G-COM3-07
Only a completed Interrogation
has one selected contractual termination.
end note

@enduml
